      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 16. Close or update project/WBS structures where the governing process requires it. Team: Finance &amp; SAP Support. Tool: SAP. Status: I. Confidence: provisional (No mandatory financial-close checklist is implied; SAP and WBS closure rules are unverified.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="BN_01" name="BN-01 Compare Planned Benefits">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 17. Review the original investment justification. Team: Sponsor &amp; Planning. Tool: Business case. Status: I. Confidence: provisional (Not a universal gate and not part of the lifecycle end point; procedure to confirm.)</bpmn:documentation>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="BN_02" name="BN-02 Measure Realised Benefits">
      <bpmn:documentation>Phase 17. Assess delivered outcomes against targets. Team: Business Owner. Tool: KPI reporting. Status: I. Confidence: provisional (Not a universal gate and not part of the lifecycle end point; procedure to confirm.)</bpmn:documentation>
